Modifications in this fork
--------------------------
  Copyright (c) 2026 @privatekey7 (https://github.com/privatekey7)

  Changes from the original work:
    - Added Russian localization (messages/ru.json)
    - Moved third-party provider API keys (Unsplash, Pexels, Pixabay)
      server-side to prevent leakage into the client bundle
    - Removed Supabase authentication and cloud-storage integration
      to enable fully local, self-hosted usage
    - Updated dependencies to address known vulnerabilities

